# 2015-1: Nag A Ram
# Write code that takes two character vectors as its first and second arguments and returns 1 if they are anagrams of each other. An anagram of a string uses all of the letters of the string ignoring word spacing, capitalisation, and punctuation.

# Solution
Solution ← ≍∩(⍆▽⊸±⌵)

# Tests
⍤⤙≍ 1 Solution "anagram" "Nag A Ram"
⍤⤙≍ 1 Solution "Dyalog APL" "Dog Pay All"
⍤⤙≍ 1 Solution "" "  !#!"
⍤⤙≍ 0 Solution "abcde" "zyxwvu"
